<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cenbank to release monetary base data.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cenbank to release monetary base data.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank will release monetary base data for the month of September at 1500 local/1700 GMT on Monday, a bank spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>In August, Brazil's monetary base shrank by 4.8 percent, reducing the rate of growth over the previous 12 months to 12.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- William Schomberg, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358</p>
</text>
